    <h2>My journey</h2>
    <p>After facing cancer and becoming an empty nester, I found myself at a crossroads. Europe became more than a duty station. It became a canvas for healing, creativity and growth.</p>
    <p>SHE FLUTTER was born from that transformation: a space to style my life with purpose, document my book journey, and connect with other women navigating change.</p>
  </div>
</section>

