    <h2>Why SEASONS</h2>
    <p>SEASONS is a novel inspired by my life. It follows Imani, a girl who grew up in the furnace, as she learns to stop bracing, to be loved without being hurt, and to raise children who never have to hold their breath.</p>
    <p>It is a story about breaking a generational curse, and about the everyday work it takes to build a love that lasts.</p>
    <blockquote class="pull">Can a girl raised in the furnace learn to be loved, and to love, without burning anybody?</blockquote>

    <div class="name-story">
